   <p>To his Excelency <persName ref="cwgk:N001000">Govenor Bramblett</persName></p>
<p>We the undesigned citizens of <unclear>Harison</unclear> County being to a considerable extent acquainted with the case of <persName ref="cwgk:N00015743">Garrett Whetson</persName> now in the Jail of this county and condemed to be hanged on the <date when="--02-09">ninth of February</date> next for the murder of a man by the name of <persName ref="cwgk:N00015780">Speckard</persName>, would respectfully state that we think him a fit subject for the Executive clemency. We therefore ask your Excellency to pardon him
<lb/><date when="1864-01">Jan 1864</date></p>
